# Headstone Pilgrimage: Behemoth's Dominion's headstone (Lightning Fragment), five of the others held. Without its
# fragment it first plays 200 (Lightning); option 0 does nothing; 3 yalms off option 1 says
# MUST_MOVE_CLOSER (7361: 0, the fragment); close by, option 1 shows AIR_AROUND_YOU_CHANGED (7339, a 0x036 message)
# and spawns the Ancient Weapon and the Legendary Weapon. With both up, and again right after the Ancient Weapon's
# kill, the headstone says SOMETHING_BETTER (7340); the trace cannot show whether the killed NM still counts as
# spawned there (the two spawn tests joined by or change no trace), so the one-up arm is pinned by a fake check.
# Each kill gives 150 XP. Once both are dead it plays 201 instead; option 0
# does nothing, 3 yalms off MUST_MOVE_CLOSER, close by option 1 gives the fragment (KEYITEM_OBTAINED 6398).
# Held, it says ALREADY_OBTAINED_FRAG (7344). A GM adds the last fragment and takes this one: 201's
# option 1 says FOUND_ALL_FRAGS (7346) and completes the mission (the Bearer of the Eight Prayers
# title, Through the Quicksand Caves current). Completed, it says ALREADY_HAVE_ALL_FRAGS (7345, section 2).
lists BehemothsDominion/Cermet_Headstone/onTrigger BehemothsDominion/onEventFinish/200 BehemothsDominion/onEventFinish/201
char zone=BehemothsDominion pos=-72,-5,-88 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Zilart HeadstonePilgrimage current
keyitem FireFragment
keyitem IceFragment
keyitem WindFragment
keyitem EarthFragment
keyitem LightFragment
login
trigger Cermet_Headstone                # no fragment, no NM up: 200
finish option=0                         # not 1: nothing
trigger Cermet_Headstone at=3           # 200
finish option=1                         # 3 yalms off: MUST_MOVE_CLOSER
trigger Cermet_Headstone                # 200
finish option=1                         # AIR_AROUND_YOU_CHANGED, the NMs spawned
trigger Cermet_Headstone                # both up: SOMETHING_BETTER
kill ANCIENT_WEAPON                     
trigger Cermet_Headstone                # after the kill: SOMETHING_BETTER
kill LEGENDARY_WEAPON                   # the last dead: 201 next
trigger Cermet_Headstone                # both NMs dead: 201
finish option=0                         # not 1: nothing
trigger Cermet_Headstone at=3           # 201
finish option=1                         # 3 yalms off: MUST_MOVE_CLOSER
trigger Cermet_Headstone                # 201
finish option=1                         # the fragment, KEYITEM_OBTAINED
trigger Cermet_Headstone                # held: ALREADY_OBTAINED_FRAG
finish-if-event
keyitem WaterFragment                   # a GM
delkeyitem LightningFragment            # a GM
trigger Cermet_Headstone                # 201
finish option=1                         # the last fragment: FOUND_ALL_FRAGS, completed
trigger Cermet_Headstone                # completed: section 2
finish-if-event
